## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
## v2 revision modules (root-level numbered directories)
## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Immutable run directories: large generated matrices, PLINK output, figures,
# logs. These stay on Quest. Provenance lives in each module README, which cites
# the run IDs, and in MIGRATION_MANIFEST.tsv.
[0-9][0-9]_*/_m/runs/
[0-9][0-9]_*/_m/logs/
[0-9][0-9]_*/_m/observed/
# 02_local_genetic_variance writes its observed runs to observed-runs/, not
# observed/, so the pattern above never matched them.
[0-9][0-9]_*/_m/observed-runs/

# Tests are hand-run smoke checks before a SLURM array, not a tracked suite.
/tests/
0[0-9]_*/tests/

# Keep the tracked pieces of _m/ explicit. The frozen calibration model itself
# (4 MB .rds) stays on Quest like every other data artifact; its SHA-256 is
# asserted in 02_local_genetic_variance/_h/04_estimate_observed_vmr.R, and the
# small provenance tables beside it are tracked so the expected checksum and the
# acceptance results are readable from a clone.
!0[0-9]_*/_m/README.md
!02_local_genetic_variance/_m/calibration_frozen/*.tsv
local-snp-prediction/oof_diagnostic/
